      "content": "uh, okay. those analogies are a bit weird, but i guess i get the concept. \n\ncan we skip the troll and goblin comparisons for a second? i'm more interested in the actual implementation. for that second step—the written warning—what specific kind of documentation do i need to be gathering to make sure it's legally sound and can actually be used if we eventually have to move to termination? i want to make sure my paper trail is ironclad.",
